This repository is Munarium Matrix core: the runtime and its roles, the asset
grammar, the refusal registry, the query compiler, materialization, reconcile,
the wire contract, the source-adapter interface, and the adapters for common
operational databases and file sources. It requires Munarium Server, which is a
separate repository under the same License.

Munarium Matrix Enterprise is a separate, proprietary product that builds on this
one: it implements the same public adapter interface to reach analytics
platforms — Databricks, BigQuery, Snowflake, Cube and dbt. It is not licensed by
this License, is not open source, and nothing here grants any right to it. An
asset naming one of those adapters validates against this repository's grammar
and is refused at execution with adapter_not_available.

The contract
------------

contract/ is the structured-evidence contract — the JSON Schemas and examples
that are the entire boundary between Matrix and the Server. contract/publish.py
cuts it as a locked bundle that the Server repository vendors. Both copies are
under the License above.

